e": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "100", "text": "If you're thinking about going on a trip, why not do more than just visit temples or suntan on the beach? Humanitarian travel is a way for travelers to improve the lives of people in destination countries, get to know local cultures, make new friends, learn about themselves, get a sense of perspective, and gain new skills. It can also be a good way to stretch a budget.<br/>\nGenerally, humanitarian tourists had better be in health and have a desire to explore. Some programs involve gap year travel for secondary school leavers, and others are mainly designed for recent university graduates or for young people in general. There are also programs designed for retirees, as well as non-profit organizations, who mainly recruit volunteers with specialized skills.", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "40000", "text": "If you're interested in environmental protection, ecotourism is another way of showing that you are a principled tourist. Ecotourism is defined by The International Ecotourism Society as \"responsible travel to natural areas that conserves the environment, sustains the well-being of the local people, and involves interpretation and education\".  If you travel responsibly, you can make a difference for both yourself and the local community.  <br/>\nSince examples of ecotourism abound, a potential eco-tourist had better learn as much as they can about the trip that awaits them. TIES has created a set of criteria that can be used to determine if a travel project can be considered ecotourism. An example is participating in an Eco-School in Guatemala, in which student tourists learn about the environmental protection and build awareness of cultural landmarks, such as the ancient Mayan ruins of Tikal.", "id": 2, "image": ""}, {"time": "87000", "text": "You had better consider a few other factors before signing up with a travel operator. Volunteering sometimes passes for unregulated, inexpensive labor. Additionally, if you choose a tour package that contains an element of volunteering, you may be buying a lower quality tour at a higher price. Organizations had better be able to prove they have close and permanent local ties, and their projects respond to needs expressed by the local community.  Individuals interested in this type of experience had better do research and compare options carefully.", "id": 3, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn11le13ob09re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}